[{"id":2609508271,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6bie-v","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"75bb2c57acfa2b817a12a45b45f12f7deacc78f1","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Looks good to me.\r\n\r\nIn the long run, I wonder if methods that accept at least one parameter (even if optional) should be denoted as `something(...)` instead, like we do in the script editor autocompletion tooltip since 4.4. We'd need to carry this change both in the editor help and class reference generation though, and it's better discussed in its own proposal.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102567#pullrequestreview-2609508271","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102567","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-02-11T17:36:21Z"},{"id":2617888351,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6cCc5f","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"75bb2c57acfa2b817a12a45b45f12f7deacc78f1","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?u=34072b401722100a7c0c0d61e37b376cf22b4545&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","login":"Repiteo","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo"},"body":"Lining up **everything** would likely require some unification of the online/editor sources, which is a mammoth of a bridge to cross when we come to it\r\n\r\nThis isolated change is harmless at worst & helps readability on top of unifying the styles; let's ship it!","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102567#pullrequestreview-2617888351","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102567","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-02-14T14:04:09Z"}]